---
title: Moroccan Pistachio Couscous
description: A quick fragrant side dish with crunchy pistachios
source: The Complete Barbecue Cookbook <urn:isbn:1740450418>
author: Family Circle
course: Side
servings: 4
locale: en_GB
difficulty: Easy
prep time: 20m
cook time: 10m
cuisine: Moroccan
diet: Vegetarian
tags:
- moroccan
- side-dish
- vegetarian
- savoury
---

Add the @saffron{pinch} to the @hot chicken stock{375%ml} and pour over the @couscous{250%g}. Set aside for ~{10%minutes}, then stir to remove lumps.

Heat the @olive oil{1%tbsp} in a frying pan, add the @red onion{1}(chopped), @red chilli{1}(seeded and chopped) and @garlic{2%cloves}(crushed) and cook for ~{3%minutes}. Add the @currants{75%g} and @pistachio nuts{100%g}(shelled) and cook for ~{5%minutes}. Stir in the @lemon rind{1}(grated) and @orange rind{1}(grated) and the @fresh mint{3%tbsp}(chopped). Stir through the couscous.